Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.24,0:00:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二修正案（允许佩戴武器）不仅很过时 而且很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Second Amendment isn`t just obsolete. It`s dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.76,0:00:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全明白你为什么这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I totally get why you think that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.08,0:00:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我之前还从不知道有谁会喜欢枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I`m sorry, I`ve just never known someone who`s into guns before.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.08,0:00:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢枪 瑞秋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I`m not into guns, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.76,0:00:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只有一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.16,0:00:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不止一把吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.76,0:01:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也不能说明我是狂热分子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doesn`t mean that I`m a fanatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.76,0:01:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也不代表我不支持管制\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, it doesn`t mean that I`m not for restrictions.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.68,0:01:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,等待期和背景审查\N{\fnArial\fs30}and waiting periods and background checks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.20,0:01:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你是什么意思 安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what does it mean, Andy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.92,0:01:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想保护自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanna be able to protect myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.52,0:01:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,要保护自己免受谁的伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}From what, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.48,0:01:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在谷歌上调查过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You googled me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.04,0:01:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.20,0:01:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的因特网\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking Internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.52,0:01:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有一段很黑暗的过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a very dark past.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.64,0:01:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.00,0:01:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么不告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why didn`t you tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.96,0:01:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.04,0:01:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想把你吓跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn`t wanna scare you away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.24,0:01:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我6岁的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was six.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.28,0:01:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的保姆被谋杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My babysitter was murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.48,0:01:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我的老师和社工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Along with my teacher and my caseworker.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.00,0:01:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些年来还有其他37个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and 37 other people over the years…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.48,0:01:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还只是我知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I`m aware of.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.76,0:02:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人抓住凶手吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they never caught him?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.92,0:02:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能说 正义得到了伸张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put it this way, justice was done.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.68,0:02:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 - 尝尝这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait! - Play with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.00,0:02:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Andy,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.68,0:02:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个好人 但这些对我来说有点过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you`re a nice guy, but, uh, this is just too much for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.08,0:02:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.84,0:02:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.36,0:04:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜今晚又只剩你和我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess it`s just me and you again tonight, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.44,0:04:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我吸一口 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a hit off that, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.72,0:05:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想玩玩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna play?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.96,0:05:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就来玩吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let`s play.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.28,0:05:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞秋呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.20,0:05:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不想玩了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn`t she wanna play?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.68,0:05:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们再也不会知道她是不是天然的红发了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we`ll never know if she`s a natural redhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.80,0:05:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,面对现实吧 安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Face it, Andy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.88,0:05:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才是你的全部\N{\fnArial\fs30}I`m all you`ve got.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.04,0:05:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候 在周五晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes, it`s nice, just hanging out on a Friday night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.68,0:05:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你最好的朋友一起玩也挺不错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}with your best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.68,0:05:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,操你妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.04,0:07:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.24,0:07:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过她瘫痪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said she was paralyzed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.76,0:08:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.52,0:08:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是因为电流\N{\fnArial\fs30}That`s just the juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.20,0:08:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.32,0:08:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,她腰部以下没有任何知觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the waist down, she`s a pincushion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.88,0:08:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, that`s enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.12,0:08:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我仍然能在我的噩梦里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can still see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.04,0:08:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}in my nightmares.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.92,0:08:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他扭曲的脸孔 惊悚的笑容\N{\fnArial\fs30}His twisted face, that horrible laugh,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.76,0:08:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他刀子的反光 还有受害者的哀嚎\N{\fnArial\fs30}the glint off his blade, the screams of his victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.24,0:08:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁的受害者 妮卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whose victims, Nica?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.88,0:08:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些谋杀都是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The murders were real.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.28,0:08:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.56,0:08:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但恰克却不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Chucky never was.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.40,0:08:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That`s right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.12,0:08:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是幻想出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a fantasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.00,0:08:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}A delusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.36,0:08:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是我的一个面具 以便我能面对我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a mask I wore so I could go on looking in the mirror,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.96,0:09:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样我才能接受我犯下的罪行\N{\fnArial\fs30}SO I could live with myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.24,0:09:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你看镜子时 会看到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, when you look in the mirror, what do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.40,0:09:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don`t look.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.56,0:09:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想学会接受自己 你就必须如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}You`ll have to, if you`re ever gonna learn to forgive yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.12,0:09:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮卡 你已经进步很多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nica, you`ve made tremendous progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.56,0:09:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,在过去的四年 你接受了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the past four years, you`ve had to accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.56,0:09:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,许多关于自己的残酷现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}some hard truths about yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.28,0:09:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很勇敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is very brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.96,0:09:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为你感到骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I`m proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.16,0:09:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把你转移到哈罗盖特精神病院\N{\fnArial\fs30}I`m having you transferred to Harrogate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.08,0:09:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮卡 那是中等戒备的医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}That`s medium security, Nica.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.76,0:09:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这意味着你有跟多的隐私和自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means more privacy, more independence, more freedom,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.16,0:09:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 是在合理范围内的\N{\fnArial\fs30}within reason, of course…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.52,0:09:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗利医生 我做的事情不可原谅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Foley, what I did was unforgivable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.52,0:09:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,精神分裂是一种病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Schizophrenia is an illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.96,0:09:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据其定义 依照法律\N{\fnArial\fs30}By definition, and according to the law,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.88,0:09:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不对你的行为负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}you weren`t responsible for your actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.88,0:09:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得艾莉丝能因为这个理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think Alice would accept that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.32,0:10:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,而原谅我让她成为孤儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}as an apology for making her an orphan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.32,0:10:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有监控吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are there no cameras?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.36,0:10:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,中等戒备的医院里没有监控\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not in medium security.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.84,0:10:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也不能肆意妄为\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don`t abuse the privilege.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.24,0:10:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,浴室在后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bathroom`s back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.88,0:10:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,淋浴是面对残疾人设计的 但你也可以叫艾希莉或帕姆帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shower`s handicap-friendly, but if you need help, ask for Ashley or Pam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.68,0:10:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们轮流值班\N{\fnArial\fs30}They alternate days.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.36,0:10:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要什么 就叫我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything else, just let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.32,0:10:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫卡洛斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name`s Carlos.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.88,0:10:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你对我这么好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for being so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.20,0:11:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,别误会 我并不喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don`t misunderstand. I`m not a fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.84,0:11:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会变成朋友 我只是在尽我的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}We`re not gonna be friends. I`m just doing my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.88,0:11:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 还是谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thank you anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.32,0:11:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You`re welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.40,0:11:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你出过事故吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You in an accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.56,0:11:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我生来就是残疾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was born like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.60,0:11:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我丈夫有多发性硬化症\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband has MS.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.36,0:11:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I`m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.40,0:11:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让这妨碍他去生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don`t let it keep him from living his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.44,0:12:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗利医生 二号房间需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Foley, your assistance is needed in room two.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.92,0:12:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,请弗利医生赶往二号房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Foley to room two, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.24,0:12:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.92,0:12:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能看见我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.16,0:12:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.28,0:12:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.80,0:12:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人都看不到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of the others can see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.16,0:13:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,别害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don`t be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.64,0:13:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不害怕你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I`m not afraid of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.16,0:13:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.00,0:13:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won`t hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.44,0:13:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想找个人说说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need someone to talk to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.60,0:13:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里度过了一生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spent my whole life here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.00,0:13:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I died.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.96,0:13:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right here in this room…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.00,0:13:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久 很久以前\N{\fnArial\fs30}A long, long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.12,0:13:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可真糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}That`s awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.12,0:13:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,安吉拉 我们都能看见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angela, we can all see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.08,0:13:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.48,0:13:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在去骚扰别人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go haunt somebody else now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.76,0:13:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没有恶意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. she`s harmless.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.12,0:13:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概30年前 他们发现她住在街上\N{\fnArial\fs30}They found her living on the street, like, 30 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.72,0:13:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡往往比无家可归更引人注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I guess being dead`s more exotic than being homeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.44,0:13:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不太明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don`t know about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.76,0:13:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果之前没死 仅仅是无家可归的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I`ve never been dead before, but I have been homeless,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.48,0:13:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那还真是无趣的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it`s pretty fucking colorless.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.44,0:13:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是迈克尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I`m Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.20,0:13:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nica.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.28,0:13:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you wanna, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.48,0:14:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的口香糖哪来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you get the gum?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.44,0:14:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡洛斯给我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, um, Carlos.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.40,0:14:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡洛斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carlos?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.32,0:14:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定给他留下了不错的印象\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must have made quite the impression.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.32,0:14:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,并没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.52,0:14:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他相当的严厉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he`s kind of a hard-ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.84,0:14:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但艾希莉护士 她是我的守护天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Nurse Ashley, she`s my guardian angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.80,0:14:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是她 我可能还在戒毒所\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn`t for her, I`d still be in detox.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.28,0:14:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是转院过来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, you just transferred?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.32,0:14:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.76,0:14:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,从哪来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where from?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.76,0:14:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛克莫尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lochmoor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.40,0:14:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是那个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}you`re that girl who…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.48,0:14:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.48,0:14:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还喜欢红头发吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still have a thing for redheads?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.44,0:14:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.60,0:14:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这个 那个 你 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the… This, you… No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.36,0:14:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 问得太早了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Sorry. That`s too soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.16,0:15:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以和你换香烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I`ll trade you for a cigarette.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.64,0:15:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.28,0:15:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,黄箭口香糖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Juicy Fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.24,0:15:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你要这么做 克莱尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why`d you do it? Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.00,0:15:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都想问呢 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We`re all wondering the same thing here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.56,0:15:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她缓一会 她还是新人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give her a break, okay? She`s new.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.20,0:15:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,去他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.28,0:15:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我要和某个屠杀了全家的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I`m gonna be living down the hallway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.84,0:15:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯子住在同一层\N{\fnArial\fs30}from someone who butchered her whole family,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.44,0:15:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有权知道她会因为什么起杀意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a right to know what set her off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.88,0:15:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那为什么你把房子烧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, why`d you burn your house down?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.16,0:15:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总提这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always bring that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.40,0:15:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 如果我们要互相指责的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I`m just saying, if we`re pointing fingers here, then…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.36,0:15:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn`t kill anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.80,0:15:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮卡也没杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither did Nica.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.24,0:15:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是恰奇干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chucky did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.00,0:16:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不怪你因为我做的事害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don`t blame you for being afraid after what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.52,0:16:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时病得很重\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was very ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.72,0:16:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在好点了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you feeling better now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.32,0:16:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我理解你的担心 当然我们应该谈一谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand your concerns, and, absolutely, we should talk about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.40,0:16:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但相信我 妮卡不对任何人造成威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, believe me, Nica isn`t a danger to anyone anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.52,0:16:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘记 她不是唯一一位\N{\fnArial\fs30}And let`s not forget, she isn`t the only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.20,0:16:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为精神失常而脱罪的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}here to benefit from an insanity plea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.88,0:16:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过她是唯一的连环杀人凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}She`s the only multiple murderer, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.04,0:16:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是屠杀 事实上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mass murderer, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.68,0:16:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,二者是有区别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There`s a difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.32,0:16:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么大不了 我们都有病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who cares? We`re all sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.68,0:16:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想知道她为什么杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna know why she killed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.80,0:16:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我病态地嫉妒我的妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was pathologically jealous of my sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.88,0:16:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对我的侄女艾莉丝占有欲太强\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I was always too possessive of Alice, who is my niece.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.72,0:16:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,她现在12岁 但我再也见不到她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She`s 12 now, and I`ll never see her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.24,0:17:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望她过得还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only hope she`s doing okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.48,0:17:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,她过得并不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}She`s not okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.48,0:17:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.24,0:17:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰奇说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chucky told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.60,0:17:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,安吉拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angela.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.04,0:17:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He called me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.84,0:17:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,打电话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.08,0:17:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他让我告诉你他要来找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said to tell you he`s coming for you…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.80,0:17:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,鉴于你现在可以见外来访客了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that you can have visitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.64,0:17:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得这很有趣吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think this is funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.60,0:17:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.08,0:17:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don`t.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.12,0:18:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 安吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It`s okay, Angie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.68,0:18:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,别害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}It`s okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.88,0:18:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这事被重提也是无法避免的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, it was inevitable that this would come up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.48,0:18:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,重要的是我们要一起讨论解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it`s important that we all explore it together as a group.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.64,0:18:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我有个东西能够帮上忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I have something that will help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.00,0:18:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好 我是恰奇 想一起玩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, I`m Chucky. Wanna play?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.00,0:18:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是 只是个好家伙公司的玩偶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a… It`s just a Good Guy doll,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.60,0:18:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,80年代造的一千个中的一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of thousands made back in the 80s.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.64,0:18:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他说自己叫恰奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he said, Chucky!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.84,0:18:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有50个不同的名字 百分之二的娃娃都叫恰奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}They had 50 different names. Two percent of them were Chucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.48,0:18:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意思是说这是巧合吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You`re saying it`s a coincidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.68,0:18:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不是 我特意买的恰奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not at all. I paid for a Chucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.16,0:18:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从哪买的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wher&d you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.80,0:18:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,在热门话题买的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hot Topic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.04,0:18:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮卡 这不会让你不适吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nica, this doesn`t make you uncomfortable, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.52,0:18:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点也不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.44,0:18:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.28,0:19:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 玛德琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it, Madeleine?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.64,0:19:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He`s my baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.80,0:19:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,张开嘴 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open up, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.48,0:19:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,小火车开过来啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here comes the choo-choo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.36,0:19:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,太烫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It`s too hot for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.36,0:19:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢有人抱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like to be hugged.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.04,0:19:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不敢相信他已经开始说话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can`t believe he`s talking already!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.52,0:19:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛德琳 别吓唬人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madeleine, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.84,0:19:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你孩子死了 你明明知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your baby is dead. You know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.40,0:19:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么毛病 就不能让她高兴一会吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is your problem? Why can`t you just let her be happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.52,0:19:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样能让她开心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think that`s the way to make her happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.16,0:19:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她和变态杀手的战利品玩过家家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Letting her play house with some psycho killer`s trophy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.64,0:19:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把他还回去 - 他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Give him back. - Him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.12,0:19:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个人称代词用得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That`s an interesting choice of pronoun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.24,0:20:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在还是是无法将现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you still having trouble separating reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.24,0:20:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,和脑子里的幻觉区分吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}from that sick shit in your head?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.60,0:20:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.76,0:20:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不幸的是 现在 在我面前呈现地很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, these days, reality is painfully clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.60,0:20:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他还回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now give him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.08,0:20:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要怎么做 妮卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do, Nica?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.68,0:20:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,砍我吗 割我的喉咙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna stab me? Cut my throat?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.24,0:20:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,砍掉我的头吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chop off my head?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.60,0:20:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,别瞎扯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don`t be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.20,0:20:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们连真的餐具都用不上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don`t even have access to real cutlery.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.44,0:20:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我唯一能拿到的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing I could get my hands on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.60,0:20:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他们每天早上给我的巴比妥\N{\fnArial\fs30}are the barbiturates they give me every morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.08,0:20:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经存了好几个月了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I`ve been stockpiling for months,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.00,0:20:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,等待着有天对哪个臭婊子下毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}waiting for the right bitch to come along to poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.76,0:20:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.44,0:20:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.96,0:20:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事 - 你还好吗 恰奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sure. - Are you okay, Chucky?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.96,0:20:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 我叫马克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I`m Mark, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.44,0:20:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你 我听说了你很多事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It`s nice to meet you. I`ve heard a lot about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.12,0:20:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.72,0:20:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克尔说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}From Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.56,0:20:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在在泳池训练 为2020年奥林匹克做准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}He`s in the pool right now, getting ready for Tokyo in 2020,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.76,0:20:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,别告诉别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}but don`t tell anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.72,0:20:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克尔·菲尔普斯吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael Phelps?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.12,0:21:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他退役了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He`s retired.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.40,0:21:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,天 太尴尬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, this is embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.84,0:21:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最讨厌犯病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fucking hate it when this happens,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.16,0:21:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是在美女面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}especially around a pretty girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.32,0:21:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我病发的诱因之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}It`s actually one of my triggers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.64,0:21:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的真名叫马尔科姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}His real name is Malcolm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.68,0:21:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们叫他多重马尔科姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}We call him Multiple Malcolm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.32,0:21:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人那么叫我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody calls me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.96,0:21:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.00,0:21:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮卡 有人找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nica, you have a visitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.00,0:21:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮卡 这位是瓦伦丁女士 你侄女的合法监护人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nica, this is Ms. Valentine, your niece`s legal guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.32,0:22:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是艾莉丝的监护人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You`re Alice`s guardian?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.96,0:22:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That`s right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.04,0:22:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 但你似乎很面熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I`m sorry, but you seem really familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.40,0:22:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有人告诉你 你长得和珍妮弗·提莉一模一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did anyone ever tell you, you look exactly like Jennifer Tilly?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.00,0:22:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,经常有人说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I get that a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.64,0:22:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我想象得也不太一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You`re not quite what I expected, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.48,0:22:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想象的是什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you expect?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.00,0:22:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,身高再高点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody taller.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.84,0:22:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看着不危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don`t seem very dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.44,0:22:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看着也不像当妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don`t seem very motherly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.44,0:22:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,她怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.08,0:22:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,她死了 皮尔斯小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}She`s dead, Miss Pierce.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.48,0:22:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.84,0:22:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦伦丁小姐 你之前告诉我就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ms. Valentine, I wish you had told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.12,0:22:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, didn`t I?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.20,0:22:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I`m terribly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.80,0:22:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是因为她的死有些难过的反应不过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I`ve just been going through an awful ordeal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.28,0:23:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她现在肯定在更好的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she`s in a better place now, I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.64,0:23:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.92,0:23:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是医生 皮尔斯小姐 但我想应该是伤心致死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I`m no doctor, Miss Pierce, but I think it was a broken heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.28,0:23:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,她想让我交给你样东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wanted you to have something.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.80,0:23:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这不是同一个 - 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That`s not the same… - No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.00,0:23:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他们在艾莉丝的心理辅导上用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the doll that they used in Alice`s therapy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.08,0:23:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮助她摆脱过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}To help her get over the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.64,0:23:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,她觉得这个也许对你有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}She thought that maybe it would help you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.96,0:23:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.16,0:23:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}That`s so sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.96,0:23:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,真谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.56,0:23:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.36,0:24:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can`t…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.52,0:26:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮卡在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where`s Nica?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.56,0:26:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,右手边最后一间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last door on the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.48,0:26:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能看到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.48,0:26:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我看得见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I can see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.88,0:26:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,别害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don`t be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.00,0:26:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.84,0:26:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I`m not going to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.16,0:27:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在耍我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fucking with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.76,0:27:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.40,0:27:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没耍你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I`m not.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.40,0:27:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话 我很愿意有人陪着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell you the truth, I`m happy to have the company,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.00,0:27:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使你不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}even if you aren`t real.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.92,0:27:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你解释一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let me explain something to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.16,0:27:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个80年代大批生产的古董娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a vintage, mass-marketed children`s toy from the 80s,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.56,0:27:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,站在你面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}standing right in front of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.48,0:27:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着非常锋利的手术刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}holding a very sharp scalpel.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.84,0:27:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you`re not.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.56,0:27:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.36,0:27:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是精神分裂患者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I`m a schizophrenic.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.44,0:27:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会出现幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see things.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.04,0:27:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是昨天晚上和我通话的那个疯女人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren`t you the crazy bitch I talked to last night on the phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.16,0:27:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候我也会幻听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes I hear things, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.32,0:27:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士 够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, lady, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.24,0:27:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个就找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You`re next.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.00,0:27:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I`m gonna be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.84,0:27:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.92,0:27:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都是疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking cuckoo`s nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.84,0:27:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.08,0:29:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗利医生 请到前台来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Foley, please report to the front desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.84,0:29:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗利医生 请到前台来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Foley, please report to the front desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.20,0:29:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,该起床了 妮卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to get up, Nica.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.08,0:29:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,七点多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It`s after 7:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.52,0:30:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.28,0:30:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.76,0:30:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.96,0:30:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.04,0:30:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你拿点水\N{\fnArial\fs30}I`ll get you some water.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.48,0:30:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave it! I…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.84,0:30:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 能不能让我一个人待会 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Could I just… Could I have some privacy, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.04,0:30:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想换个衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}I`d like to get dressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.20,0:30:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.08,0:31:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,急救警报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Code blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.00,0:31:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴克利先生 我现在特别忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Barclay, I`m extremely busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.28,0:32:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可不是在耍猴\N{\fnArial\fs30}We`re not running a circus here,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.80,0:32:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能有话直说\N{\fnArial\fs30}so could you please just get to the point?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.72,0:32:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,演得不错 巴克雷\N{\fnArial\fs30}That`s very clever, Mr. Barclay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.60,0:32:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,真像那回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very convincing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.44,0:32:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.76,0:32:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还活着 看看他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He`s alive. Just look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.64,0:32:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该去拍电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should get a job in the movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.08,0:32:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要见妮卡·皮尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna see Nica Pierce.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.48,0:32:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,能否送巴克雷先生出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you please show Mr. Barclay out?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.16,0:32:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你 不是她干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I`m telling you, she didn`t do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.08,0:32:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let`s go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.48,0:32:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,再看一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let`s watch it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.48,0:32:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是百看不厌\N{\fnArial\fs30}That one just never gets old.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.76,0:32:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮个忙 恰奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do me a favor, Chucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.00,0:32:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭上你的臭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your fucking mouth shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.52,0:32:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你猜怎么的 安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what, Andy?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.00,0:32:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一你真的疯了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if you really are crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.84,0:32:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没想过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever thought of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.52,0:32:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你应该和尼卡一样进精神病院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you belong in the booby hatch with Nica.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.92,0:33:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许这真的是你脑中幻想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe this really is just all in your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.16,0:33:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮卡 不是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nica, it wasn`t your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.68,0:33:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,扯淡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.96,0:33:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.20,0:33:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我照顾了那女人五年\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took care of that woman for the past five years.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.36,0:33:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给她洗头 擦屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}I washed her hair. I wiped her ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.72,0:33:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还听她说疯话到凌晨3点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I listened to her crazy until 3:00 in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.20,0:33:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.88,0:33:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她想自杀 我肯定会知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she was thinking about killing herself, I`d have known it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.72,0:33:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不一定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not necessarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.88,0:33:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是妮卡做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nica did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.20,0:33:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在安吉拉的血里她留下了自己的签名\N{\fnArial\fs30}She left her fucking calling card in Angela`s blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.04,0:33:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,安吉拉是自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angela did that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.20,0:33:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,她为什么要那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would she do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.52,0:33:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.76,0:33:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是不是忽略了另外一个可能性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren`t we overlooking one other possibility?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.84,0:33:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不那么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don`t think we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.52,0:33:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔 你还没受够被人误会吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire, don`t you ever get tired of being wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.36,0:33:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I do not!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.84,0:33:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥卡姆剃刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Occam`s razor.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.08,0:33:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,最简单的解释通常就是对的解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}The simplest explanation is usually the right one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.72,0:33:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰奇干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chucky did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.96,0:33:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉我们来晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I`m so sorry we`re late.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.12,0:33:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不敢相信他们已经开始挖安吉拉的坟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can`t believe they`re digging Angela`s grave already.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.68,0:34:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下 现在有两个娃娃了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute, there`s two of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.92,0:34:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这娃娃真丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}What an ugly doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.68,0:34:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 我是恰奇 想一起玩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, I`m Chucky. Wanna play?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.08,0:34:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是哪来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell did he come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.40,0:34:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝送的\N{\fnArial\fs30}From Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.60,0:34:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她监护人带来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}From her guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.32,0:34:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,她叫什么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did that woman say her name was?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.00,0:34:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦伦丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Valentine.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.00,0:34:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.56,0:34:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒂凡尼·瓦伦丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tiffany Valentine.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.48,0:34:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是查尔斯·李·雷的女友\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was Charles Lee Ray`s girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.84,0:34:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 查尔斯·李·雷 - 那是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Charles Lee Ray? - Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.88,0:34:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是80年代的连环杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a serial killer in the 80s.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.56,0:34:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在玩具店被开枪打死之前杀了22个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He murdered 22 people before they shot him in a toy store.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.20,0:34:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就死在好家伙玩偶的旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}He died right next to a Good Guy doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.28,0:34:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯·李·雷的昵称就是恰奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles Lee Ray`s nickname was Chucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.48,0:34:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再让她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please tell me that you are not gonna let her.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.64,0:34:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,用一派胡言鼓动人心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}dominate the group with this crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.28,0:34:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮卡 它只是个娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nica, it`s just a doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.12,0:34:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那就证明出来 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Then prove it. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.68,0:34:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里证明它只是个娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right here to everybody in this room, prove that it`s just a doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.76,0:35:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.60,0:35:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 接着烧 - 太荒谬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not yet. - Oh, this is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.20,0:36:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等下 换另一个 - 妮卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait a minute, now him. - Nica.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.72,0:36:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没准他俩调换了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could`ve switched places with it somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.56,0:36:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,别烦我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You leave my baby alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.88,0:36:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.08,0:36:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.08,0:36:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.48,0:36:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为已经讨论过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we were way past this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.96,0:36:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Iwas wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.08,0:36:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,它不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.88,0:36:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但另一个呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what about the other one?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.08,0:36:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去消灭他吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let`s just go and get rid of him. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.64,0:36:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,以防万一 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better safe than sorry, that`s what I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.60,0:36:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有机会的时候为什么没杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why didn`t he kill you when he had the chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.08,0:37:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他想折磨我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he`s fucking with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.96,0:37:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他的作风\N{\fnArial\fs30}That`s what he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.28,0:37:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 他会把这里的人一个个杀掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, he`ll kill each and every one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.36,0:37:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,以你能想到最残忍的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the most horrible ways you can imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.36,0:37:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他会让我看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he`ll make me watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.72,0:37:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后也把我杀掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then he`ll kill me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.92,0:37:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,又或者 我只是个疯子这一切都是我想象的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless, of course, I`m a complete psychopath.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.44,0:37:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是往好的方面想吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let`s just stay positive.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.72,0:37:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛德琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madeleine!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.76,0:37:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛德琳去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where`s Madeleine going?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.16,0:37:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,她带孩子出门散步了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She took her baby out for a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.12,0:37:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是别烦她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think you should leave her alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.88,0:37:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须去找她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to go get her.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.96,0:37:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I can`t.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.08,0:37:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.80,0:37:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的户外权限被取消了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My outdoor privileges were suspended.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.48,0:37:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我侵入过弗利医生的电脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hacked into Dr. Foley`s computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.96,0:37:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was ridiculously easy,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.16,0:37:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,比当市值两千亿公司的首席执行官简单多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}a lot easier than being CEO of a $200 billion corporation.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.64,0:37:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在又是马克·扎克伯格了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You`re Mark Zuckerberg now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.76,0:37:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.24,0:38:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.96,0:38:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去搞定艾希莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I`ll take care of Ashley.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.56,0:38:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 但我必须说 这注意不太妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, fine, but, for the record, I think this is a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.32,0:38:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I`m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.32,0:38:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,能帮我一下吗 我不太熟悉这个轮椅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you help me with this? I`m not used to this chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.72,0:38:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没问题 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sure. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.12,0:38:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里 有东西卡住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It`s just right over here. I think there`s something stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.64,0:38:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it`s right in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.76,0:38:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.16,0:38:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我靠 克莱尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit. Claire?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.28,0:38:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.64,0:38:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,福利博士 都是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Foley, it`s true.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.88,0:38:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He`s alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.56,0:39:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次你又对你自己做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you done to yourself now?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.92,0:39:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 不 是他咬的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No! It was him!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.56,0:39:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔 跟我们走一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire, why don`t you come with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.72,0:39:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.56,0:39:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是他做的 是他做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it was him. It was him!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.72,0:39:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.24,0:39:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.52,0:39:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,快停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.72,0:39:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 让我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.44,0:39:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是的 傻逼快放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Let me fucking go! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.88,0:40:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛德琳 马德琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maddy! Madeleine!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.00,0:40:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.08,0:40:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.92,0:40:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你 别把我留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Please, don`t leave me here!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.24,0:40:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制住她了 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got her! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.84,0:40:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.32,0:40:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗利博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Foley!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.60,0:41:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗利博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Foley!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.32,0:41:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,放轻松 克莱尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just relax, Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.60,0:41:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓 我不再纠结了 也不会再伤害自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear. I`m over… I won`t hurt myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.52,0:41:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.56,0:41:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.04,0:41:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这群傻逼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fuckers!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.00,0:41:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这群杀千刀的傻逼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You blood fucking morons!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.56,0:41:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.92,0:41:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会把我们都杀掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He`ll kill us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.16,0:41:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给她注射了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you give her?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.32,0:41:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,10cc的美索比妥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten CCs of Methohexital.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.20,0:41:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,足够让她平静了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just enough to relax her.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.48,0:41:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还有意识 但就是不能动弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}She`s conscious, but she just won`t be able to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.68,0:41:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有看过她这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever seen her like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.96,0:41:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 从没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.64,0:41:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点闹心 但看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}It`s, uh, disturbing, but it`s fascinating to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.44,0:41:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样大规模的癔症发作很有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}this kind of mass hysteria in action.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.36,0:41:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实挺惨的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It`s quite sad, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.12,0:41:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 杰克怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, how's Jake?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.64,0:41:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还不错 多谢关心\N{\fnArial\fs30}He`s hanging in there, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.88,0:41:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的周年纪念就要到了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don`t you guys have an anniversary coming up?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.72,0:41:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.76,0:41:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于决定带他去见我的父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally taking him to meet my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.88,0:42:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,马尔科姆出事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It`s Malcolm.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.04,0:42:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这边需要帮助 噢 天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I`m gonna need some help. Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.12,0:42:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松点 克莱尔 我马上就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just… Just relax, Claire. I`ll be back in a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.32,0:43:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.72,0:43:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,压缩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Compressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.52,0:43:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我想的意思一样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does that rnean what I think it rneans?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.76,0:44:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, I`m not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.52,0:44:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.48,0:44:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候我连自己都怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes, I scare myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.12,0:45:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.32,0:45:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为只有一个我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thought I was the only one?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.96,0:45:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.68,0:45:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,要干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What`s going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.16,0:46:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是恰奇做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chucky did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.88,0:46:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只是个意外 妮卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was an accident, Nica.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.60,0:46:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,安吉拉也是被他所杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}He killed Angela, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.76,0:46:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会假装你刚刚什么都没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I`m gonna pretend you didn`t just say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.84,0:46:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有马德琳 他在操控着她\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Madeleine, he`s manipulating her.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.68,0:46:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮卡 她有幻想症\N{\fnArial\fs30}She`s delusional, Nica.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.04,0:46:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她和你一样 对娃娃产生幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's projecting onto the doll, just like you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.68,0:46:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会证明一切的 弗利博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I`m going to prove it, Dr. Foley.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.04,0:46:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know what else?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.20,0:46:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那两个娃娃可能都是活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think both dolls are alive somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.84,0:46:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,快快醒来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ade beaucoup Damballa.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.68,0:46:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这听起来很荒唐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how crazy that sounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.24,0:46:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个和一个活娃娃听起来都差不多疯狂 妮卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}No crazier than a single doll, Nica.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.20,0:46:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,请告诉我你理解我的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please tell me you understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.60,0:46:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to the other one?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.44,0:46:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人拿走了 我们会找出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone took it, and we`ll find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.48,0:46:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道呢 也许就在你的房间里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knows, maybe in your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.52,0:46:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在怀疑我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think it was me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.88,0:46:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮卡 我跟你说实话在这个节骨眼上\N{\fnArial\fs30}To tell you the truth, Nica, at this point,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.76,0:46:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的不知道该去怀疑谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I honestly don`t knowwhatto think.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.72,0:46:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗利博士 我不是杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I`m not a killer, Dr. Foley.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.08,0:46:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我他妈没疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I`m not fucking crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.12,0:47:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮卡 我想要你为我做件事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nica, I want you to do something for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.08,0:47:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要催眠你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna hypnotize you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.72,0:47:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,催眠我也不会有任何改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hypnotizing me is not gonna make a difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.08,0:47:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,在过去可是很有用的一招\N{\fnArial\fs30}It`s been very useful in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.96,0:47:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以让大家都放心\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it might set our minds at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.96,0:47:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,没准能发现真相呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We might find out what really happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.92,0:47:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮卡 我不想把你送回洛克马\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nica, I don`t wanna have to send you back to Lochmoor.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.52,0:47:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,催眠法能帮助人接受现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hypnosis helped you accept the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.68,0:47:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在害怕接受现实吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, are you afraid of the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.20,0:47:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,十分害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terrified.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.00,0:47:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也应该害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you should be, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.96,0:48:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,盯着灯光 妮卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your eyes on the light, Nica.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.24,0:48:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 妮卡 你感觉怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Nica, how do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.76,0:48:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Receptive.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.84,0:48:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}As always, that`s good.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.48,0:48:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我告诉你在这里每个角落都有摄像头\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I were to tell you there are cameras at H arrogate,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.00,0:48:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,隐藏摄像头 到处都是 以至于你的每个动作都被记录下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}hidden cameras, everywhere, and your every move has been recorded?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.00,0:48:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我说 妮卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I were to tell you, Nica,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.16,0:48:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有你杀掉克莱尔和安吉拉的记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}there are recordings of you killing both Angela and Claire?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.84,0:48:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会怎么回应\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would you say to that?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.96,0:48:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法对那样的证据做出辩解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I couldn`t really argue with evidence like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.20,0:48:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能想象到是如何杀了她们的 对吗 妮卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can picture yourself killing them, can`t you, Nica?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.88,0:49:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.00,0:49:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在 证据被抹去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, what if that evidence then somehow got erased?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.92,0:49:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说是谁会想要那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who would wanna do that, do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.88,0:49:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.92,0:49:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该会第一个想到自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}would be my first guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.08,0:49:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.88,0:49:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们在谋杀和录影带还有你的负罪感\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we`re in agreement about the murders and the tapes.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.08,0:49:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,方面达成共识\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your terrible guilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.68,0:49:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.20,0:49:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.08,0:49:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.72,0:49:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就在你后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}He`s right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.36,0:50:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很怀念我们之间的这种小会面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I`ve missed these little sessions of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.40,0:50:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven`t you?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.20,0:50:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.40,0:50:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当然不怀念\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.56,0:50:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟你什么都不记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can`t remember them.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.80,0:50:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也许是最好的结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.44,0:50:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.96,0:50:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,居然有人说我变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they call me sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.04,0:50:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个人简直就是穷凶极恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy is… Is… Is diabolical!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.68,0:50:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真是奇葩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what a piece of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.44,0:50:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都有点嫉妒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I`m actually a little envious.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.88,0:50:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你想要杀他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know you want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.56,0:50:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don`t you?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.88,0:50:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.32,0:50:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 妮卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Nica.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.48,0:50:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候加入我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to join the club.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.56,0:51:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮卡姑姑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Auntie Nica.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.88,0:51:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱丽丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.00,0:51:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们等你好久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We`ve been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.44,0:53:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗利博士总说迟到的人是没有礼貌的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Foley always says late people are rude people.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.44,0:53:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太不像他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is so unlike him.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.00,0:53:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,迟来的弗利博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}The late Dr. Foley.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.72,0:53:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说还挺顺口的 不是吗 妮卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that has a nice ring to it, doesn`t it, Nica?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.96,0:53:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望他安然无恙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sure hope nothing`s happened to him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.60,0:53:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是不禁去想谁下一个死\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just kind of makes you wonder who`s next.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.92,0:53:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn`t it?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.12,0:53:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么了 马克\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is wrong with you, Mark?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.80,0:53:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不叫马克\N{\fnArial\fs30}That`s not my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.36,0:53:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你他妈今天叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, what the hell is your name today?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.60,0:53:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It`s Charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.96,0:53:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we`ve met.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.52,0:53:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,马德琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madeleine?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.08,0:53:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能抱抱他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I hold him?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.52,0:54:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把它放床上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I better put him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.80,0:54:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有点不耐烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He`s getting a little cranky.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.84,0:54:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,马德琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madeleine.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.60,0:54:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗利博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Foley.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.44,0:54:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.84,0:54:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的头简直快要炸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a hell of a headache.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.36,0:54:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不记得了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.56,0:54:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得你催眠了我 然后就\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember you hypnotized me, and then…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.64,0:54:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,其余的就有点模糊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rest is kind ofa blur.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.40,0:54:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打了我 妮卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}You assaulted me, Nica.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.12,0:54:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He isn't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.32,0:54:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.08,0:54:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很担心你这次复发\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am very concerned by this setback,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.04,0:54:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但此事如果你不说\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I am willing to keep my mouth shut about this incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.96,0:54:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不会说出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.24,0:55:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.44,0:55:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.68,0:55:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Andy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.24,0:55:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.24,0:55:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒂凡尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tiffany.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.00,0:55:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹尼弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jennifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.48,0:55:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己都记不清了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even I lose track.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.12,0:55:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.44,0:55:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去抓你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.08,0:55:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.56,0:55:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 我们现在是三个人哟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, there's three of us at the moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.08,0:55:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的队伍越来越壮大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the cult is growing all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.52,0:55:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 你想加入我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Andy, you wanna join up?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.00,0:55:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.48,0:55:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我有一条来自恰奇的口信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I have a message from Chucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.68,0:55:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说你会知道是什么意思的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said you'll know what it means.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.92,0:55:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个单词\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a single word.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.64,0:55:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说 开膛破肚\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said, Disembowel.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.24,0:56:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 现在你来说说是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, what do you suppose that means, Andy?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.32,0:57:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛德琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madeleine?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.84,0:57:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛德琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madeleine!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.32,0:57:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没停止过爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never stopped loving you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.04,0:57:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远都是你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your friend to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.00,0:57:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰奇 男孩最好的朋友就是他的妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Chucky, a boy's best friend is his mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.88,0:57:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想玩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanna play?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.28,0:58:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛德琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madeleine!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.96,0:58:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛德琳 你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madeleine, what have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.92,0:58:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.00,0:58:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛德琳 你对你的孩子做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you done to your baby, Madeleine?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.40,0:58:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是个孩子 只是个玩具娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a baby, it's just a doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.52,0:58:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.88,0:58:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,约书亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joshua.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.76,0:58:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.76,0:58:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对他做了什么 玛德琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do to him, Madeleine?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.84,0:58:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,说出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.12,0:58:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.44,0:58:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常 非常抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so, so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.48,0:58:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用对我说 玛德琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to me, Madeleine.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.76,0:58:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say it to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.92,0:59:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的小甜心 你能原谅我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sweet angel, can you ever forgive me?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.52,0:59:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他总是哭\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just wouldn't stop crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.44,0:59:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论我做什么 他都不停\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter what I did, I couldn't make him stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.60,0:59:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那声音就像一块锋利的玻璃刺进我的头里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sound was like a sharp piece of glass drilling into my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.60,0:59:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个恶母\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a terrible mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.00,0:59:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远不能让他开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could never make him happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.40,0:59:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有杀掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.68,0:59:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 妮卡 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Nica, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.00,0:59:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是在假装\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just pretending.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.32,0:59:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放开他 - 他还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Leave him alone! - He's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.92,0:59:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢被抱着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like to be hugged.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.32,0:59:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我比谁都希望他是假死\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than anything, I wish that he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.84,0:59:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但希望也没有用 我现在是知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wishing won't bring him back. I know that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.00,1:00:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.32,1:00:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只是个娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a doll.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.64,1:00:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他象征了你的内疚 马尔科姆的误会\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's a powerful symbol of your guilt, Malcolm's confusion,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.52,1:00:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the past.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.20,1:00:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不觉得是时候永绝后患埋葬过去了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, don't you think it's time to bury the past once and for all?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.32,1:00:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无疑问 复活的希望和永恒的生命都将通过\N{\fnArial\fs30}In sure and certain hope of the resurrection unto eternal life.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.88,1:00:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的主耶稣基督\N{\fnArial\fs30}through our Lord Jesus Christ,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.32,1:00:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们赞美我们爱戴的全能的神\N{\fnArial\fs30}we commend unto Almighty God our loved ones,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.96,1:00:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把自己的身体都献给大地\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we commit their bodies to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.88,1:00:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,尘归尘 土归土 生终将死 灵终将灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earth to earth, ashes to ashes, dust to dust.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.40,1:00:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿我们的主祝福他们 护佑他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}May the Lord bless them and keep them.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.72,1:00:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,并将他的光照耀在他们身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and shine His light down upon them.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.04,1:00:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他们以恩惠 给他们以平和\N{\fnArial\fs30}and be gracious unto them and give them peace.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.56,1:00:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amen.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.00,1:01:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是不信 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not buying it, are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.88,1:01:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.60,1:01:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.72,1:01:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他总能回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He always comes back.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.04,1:01:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜访时间结束了 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Visiting hours are over, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.44,1:01:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦你掉头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna have to ask you to turn around.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.76,1:01:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要立刻见弗利医生或者是妮卡·皮尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to see Dr. Foley, or Nica Pierce, right away.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.12,1:01:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你可以打电话预约一下时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you can call and make an appointment.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.44,1:01:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这是紧急情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, this is an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.80,1:01:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白 但现在 请你回到你的车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet, but now, please, just get back in your car.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.12,1:01:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后调头开走 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and turn it around, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.28,1:01:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我要入院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, then I wanna commit myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.68,1:01:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧他妈的离开这里 马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the hell out of here! Right now!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.36,1:02:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Night-night.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.16,1:03:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是刚刚寄给你的 弗利医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}This just came for you, Dr. Foley.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.04,1:03:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁寄来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's it from?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.12,1:03:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有写\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't say.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.32,1:03:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他头发怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to his hair?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.36,1:03:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么会有人寄这个给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would anyone send this to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.20,1:03:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我们有更重要的事情要担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we've got way more important things to worry about right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.44,1:03:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 先去查房吧 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's get on our rounds. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.68,1:04:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能留鞋带\N{\fnArial\fs30}No shoelaces.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.16,1:04:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他仅剩的东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all I have left of him.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.52,1:04:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗利医生把你列入自杀监管名单了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Foley put you on suicide watch.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.16,1:04:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果死了能见到他 我会做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I'd do it if I thought I could see him again.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.04,1:04:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是自杀不能去天堂 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But suicides don't go to heaven, do they?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.44,1:04:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛德琳 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, Madeleine.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.80,1:04:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道我自己有两个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just know I have two children of my own,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.08,1:05:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我会做任何事情来确保他们安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'd do anything to keep them safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.68,1:05:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会为了他们杀人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you kill for them if it was for their own good?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.32,1:05:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那么爱他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you love them that much?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.00,1:05:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿什利护士 请到护士站来一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nurse Ashley, please report to the nurses' station.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.52,1:05:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会每15分钟查看你一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be checking on you every 15 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.52,1:05:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 宝宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.40,1:05:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会理解我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just don't get us.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.44,1:05:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远不会理解的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they never will.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.92,1:05:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,母爱长存\N{\fnArial\fs30}A mother's love never dies.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.80,1:05:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀死孩子的时候也爱着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even when she kills it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.88,1:05:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, please,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.36,1:05:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}one last time,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.76,1:05:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到妈妈身边吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}come to Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.88,1:06:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,会很疼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will it hurt?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.76,1:06:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会尽力避免的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.68,1:08:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天可真不是个好日子 对吧 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're having a bad day, aren't you, Doc?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.40,1:08:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿什利 带他回病床\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashley, put him to bed.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.80,1:08:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗利医生 我觉得我不能再干下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Foley, I don't think I can do this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.52,1:08:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 太诡异了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - It's too much.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.04,1:08:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.60,1:08:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,回床上去 马尔科姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to bed, Malcolm.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.20,1:08:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.28,1:08:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这东西扔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get rid of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.64,1:08:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.40,1:09:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nica?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.28,1:09:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you get in here?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.84,1:09:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a fucking guess.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.48,1:09:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这是开玩笑 今天可不是时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this is a joke, this is not a good day for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.12,1:09:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是恰奇干得\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Chucky.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.56,1:10:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我总爱上疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do I always fall for the crazy ones?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.56,1:10:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛德琳死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madeleine's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.80,1:10:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是恰奇干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chucky did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.04,1:10:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.48,1:10:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是自杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She killed herself.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.76,1:10:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,她把它挖了出来还自残\N{\fnArial\fs30}She dug him up and mutilated herself.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.08,1:10:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,造成恰奇干的假象\N{\fnArial\fs30}so it looked like Chucky did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.32,1:10:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.44,1:10:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非全是你杀的 妮卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you killed them all, Nica.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.72,1:10:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 这对我来说并不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it doesn't really matter to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.20,1:10:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为 无论哪种方式 都能写一本好书\N{\fnArial\fs30}because, either way, it's gonna make a hell of a book.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.44,1:10:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是现在 你必须要回到洛克马\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now, you're gonna have to go back to Lochmoor.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.00,1:10:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,太可怜了 毕竟在这里 我可以给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too bad, because here, I could've given you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.16,1:11:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多私人关心\N{\fnArial\fs30}so much more personal attention.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.96,1:11:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna kill you, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.56,1:11:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna die,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.64,1:11:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我会告诉大家真正的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm gonna tell everybody about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.08,1:11:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被诊断为精神分裂症\N{\fnArial\fs30}You`re a diagnosed schizophrenic.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.00,1:12:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且还是杀害五个人的凶手 这还只是我们目前所知的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a murderess of five people, that we know of.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.68,1:12:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人会听你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one`s going to listen to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.68,1:12:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是拿他没办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just can`t with this guy!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.92,1:12:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道是该学他还是杀掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don`t know whether to kill him or just take notes.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.76,1:12:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再来做一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we`re gonna try this again.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.04,1:12:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I`m not a killer.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.80,1:12:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不是而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.68,1:12:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.12,1:12:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He`s here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.04,1:12:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,真够墨迹的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took him long enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.48,1:12:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,蠢孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.72,1:12:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪已经不是孩子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy`s not a kid anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.80,1:13:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what`s your point?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.12,1:13:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是说 我们理应小心行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I`m just saying, it behooves us to watch our step.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.32,1:13:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,理应 听听你自己的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behooves. Listen to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.88,1:13:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听起来像是汉尼拔·莱克特\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sound like Hannibal Lecter.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.36,1:13:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信他们取消了那个节目\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can`t believe they canceled that show.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.40,1:13:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是从哪冒出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd he come from?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.92,1:13:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在乎 唤醒他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who cares? Wake him up.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.92,1:13:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,伟大的丹巴拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ade beaucoup Damballa.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.08,1:13:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我乞求你 赐予我力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the power, I beg of you!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.00,1:13:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你脑袋怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.84,1:13:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢做我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I love being me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.08,1:13:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢我的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I love my job.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.08,1:13:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是在最后一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially the look on my victim`s face.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.44,1:13:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,当他们意识到\N{\fnArial\fs30}when they realize, in that final moment,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.32,1:13:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切都在真实发生的时候的表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}that it`s all really happening.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.80,1:13:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个小孩的玩具用一把码尺活活把人打死\N{\fnArial\fs30}A children`s toy is actually beating them to death with a yardstick!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.08,1:13:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者把他们点着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or setting them on fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.48,1:13:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者把他们开膛破肚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eviscerating them.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.76,1:14:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是真实的案例\N{\fnArial\fs30}All actual examples.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.56,1:14:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,几年前 我在\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few years ago, I came across this groovy new spell.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.60,1:14:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,傻瓜巫毒术网站上找到的这条绝妙的咒语改变了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}on VoodooForDummies.com that changed everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.20,1:14:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我成为我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I can be me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.00,1:14:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And me. And me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.96,1:14:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,理论上讲 可以成为任何有两条腿和\N{\fnArial\fs30}And theoretically, anyone or anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.16,1:14:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个能捅人的胳膊\N{\fnArial\fs30}with two legs and a hand for stabbing.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.16,1:14:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如爱丽丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like Alice.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.20,1:14:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,一开始很有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was fun for a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.36,1:14:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们对可爱的小女孩的信任几乎和对可爱的玩偶一样深\N{\fnArial\fs30}People trust cute little girls almost as much as cute little dolls,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.92,1:14:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是小女儿在受害者还手的时候会受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}but little girls can get hurt when their victims try to fight back.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.48,1:14:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后她们就不那么可爱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then they ain`t so cute anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.32,1:14:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.96,1:14:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.68,1:15:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.48,1:15:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我钻他的时候他的表情最有意思了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He made the funniest face when I drilled him!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.04,1:15:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到我把他的肚皮划开时候的热气了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see the steam when I sliced open his guts?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.68,1:15:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没感觉如此充满活力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I`ve never felt so alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.56,1:15:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你也才活了两分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, you`ve been alive for, like, two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.52,1:15:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎加入 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the cult, pal.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.16,1:15:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 谢谢 你们最棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Thanks. You guys are the best.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.96,1:15:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去杀安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I`m gonna go kill Andy.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.60,1:15:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我想杀安迪 这是我应得的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I wanna kill Andy. I earned it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.16,1:15:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今天受得够多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I`ve been through a lot today.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.92,1:15:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今天还吸奶奶了 看看我都经历了些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to suck titty today. Look what happened to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.92,1:15:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 看看我的头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Look at my hair.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.08,1:15:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 该死 你赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit. You win.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.24,1:16:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对的 抱歉 伙计 你去好好收拾他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely. Sorry, pal. You go fuck him up real good.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.20,1:16:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩的愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.44,1:16:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 守好门\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, guard the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.12,1:16:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁要想进来就把他杀掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill anyone that tries to get in.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.08,1:16:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.68,1:16:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来处理她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I`ll take care of her.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.96,1:17:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,樱桃甜筒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cherry snow cone.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.32,1:17:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,真美味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yummy.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.28,1:17:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,快动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just fucking do it already.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.96,1:17:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我解脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it over with.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.04,1:17:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我想让你死 你早就死翘翘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I wanted you dead, you`d be tits-up by now.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.52,1:17:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不会杀你的 妮卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was never gonna kill you, Nica.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.16,1:17:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 有比死更可怕的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, there`s worse things than death.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.80,1:17:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,伟大的丹巴拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ade beaucoup Damballa.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.64,1:17:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我乞求你 给予我力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me all the power, I beg of you!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.00,1:18:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiya, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.28,1:19:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,被超自然邪灵附身还是有好处的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There`s definitely perks to being supernaturally possessed.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.80,1:19:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是替妮卡踩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is for Nica.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.80,1:20:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.84,1:20:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed her.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.48,1:20:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让那个婊子得到了应有的下场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave that bitch what she deserved.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.76,1:20:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you didn`t.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.36,1:20:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed her.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.76,1:20:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我是查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I`m Charles!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.12,1:20:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,做梦吧 混球\N{\fnArial\fs30}In your dreams, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.80,1:20:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I`m Charles.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.20,1:20:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是所有人都叫我恰奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}But everybody calls me Chucky.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.60,1:20:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人那么叫我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody calls me that.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.04,1:20:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 等 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait a… Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.12,1:20:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who am I now?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.24,1:20:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是个模仿者 真变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}You`re a fucking poser. You`re sick.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.92,1:20:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不像我那么搞笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}And not in the fun way like me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.68,1:20:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nica?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.80,1:20:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮卡在睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nica`s taking a nap.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.48,1:20:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会确保她永远也醒不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I`m gonna make sure she never wakes up.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.44,1:21:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想变成有意义的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanna be someone who matters.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.48,1:21:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我不是马克 我不是迈克尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I`m not Mark. I`m not Michael. I`m…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.12,1:21:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是马尔科姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I`m just Malcolm.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.68,1:21:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的马尔科姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking Multiple Malcolm.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.92,1:21:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎你脑子里很挤啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like it`s getting pretty crowded in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.00,1:21:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还能听到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can hear him.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.16,1:21:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还能听到恰奇在我的脑袋里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can still hear Chucky inside my head!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.72,1:21:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个地方可真有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it was such a nice place to visit.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.08,1:22:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪·巴克利 真意外啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy Barclay, as I live and breathe.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.32,1:22:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.00,1:22:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.52,1:22:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.72,1:22:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,游戏结束 混球\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the end, fucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.84,1:23:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你寄的我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sent me?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.52,1:23:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢你来找我 省了我不少麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for coming after me. You saved me the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.52,1:23:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.00,1:23:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了我 就等于杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kill me, you kill her.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.80,1:23:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.56,1:23:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 输家才思考\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, thinking is for losers.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.88,1:23:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,封锁 此设施进入封锁状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lockdown. The facility is now on lockdown.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.60,1:23:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,病人请立即回到病房\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patients to your rooms, immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.40,1:23:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,碰到就是你了 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tag, you`re it, pal.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.24,1:23:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.64,1:24:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,保安 西侧走廊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Security, west hail.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.60,1:24:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,保安 西侧走廊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Security, code one in west hail.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.80,1:24:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 娃娃脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, sweet-face.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.80,1:25:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴看到你又变回人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to see you back on your feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.88,1:25:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来很不错 蒂芙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look great, Tiff.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.48,1:25:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,和以前不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is different.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.24,1:25:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don`t know.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.12,1:25:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Works for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.00,1:25:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过有些事还是没变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some things never change, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.00,1:25:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的经典永不过时\N{\fnArial\fs30}!!A true classic never goes out of style.!!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.28,1:25:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我说过一次 在扎了一个男的39刀之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said that to me once, after stabbing a man 39 times.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.04,1:25:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.64,1:26:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是为爱丽丝感到难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just feeling bad about Alice.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.24,1:26:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,有她在身边感觉很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was kind of nice, having Alice around, you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.04,1:26:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不 去她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, fuck that kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.44,1:30:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.88,1:30:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪派我来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy sent me.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.48,1:30:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们好好玩玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We`re gonna have some fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.48,0:45:37.25,Note,0,0,0,0,,（又是恰奇做的吗？精神病院二人死亡）
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.54,1:01:23.65,Note,0,0,0,0,,（联邦快递）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.59,0:09:27.65,Note,0,0,0,0,,（哈罗盖特精神病院）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.68,0:06:39.65,Note,0,0,0,0,,（当地女性杀害五人）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.68,0:06:43.65,Note,0,0,0,0,,（唯一幸存者 爱丽丝·皮尔斯 7岁）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.88,0:06:49.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（出生地：美国 普罗维登斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.92,0:23:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我是恰克 想一起玩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, I'm Chucky, want to play?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.88,0:30:12.75,Note,0,0,0,0,,（别着急）
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.88,0:31:52.75,Note,0,0,0,0,,（恰克做的）
